---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /services/cgi-visualisation/index.html
title: Architectural CGI & Property Visualisation – Curated Design Studio
description: Photorealistic interior CGI and three-dimensional property walkthroughs for design presentations, property marketing and refurbishment proposals.
htmlClass: services-page
bodyClass: services-page font-inter
---
{% from "partials/backlink.njk" import breadcrumb %}
<main id="main-content" class="page-main" tabindex="-1">
    {{ breadcrumb([{ href: "/", label: "Home" }, { href: "/services/", label: "Services" }, { label: "CGI & Visualisation" }]) }}
    <header class="projects-header">
        <p class="projects-header__eyebrow">CGI &amp; Visualisation</p>
        <div>
            <h1 class="projects-header__title">Architectural CGI &amp; Property Visualisation</h1>
            <p class="projects-header__intro">Explore the potential of a property through photorealistic imagery and immersive three-dimensional walkthroughs.</p>
        </div>
    </header>
    <section class="projects-section cgi-demonstration" aria-labelledby="walkthrough-title">
        <div class="projects-section__inner">
            <h2 id="walkthrough-title" class="projects-header__title">3D walkthrough demonstration</h2>
            {% if site.servicesPage.walkthroughVideo %}
            <video class="cgi-demonstration__video" controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="walkthrough-title"
                {% if site.servicesPage.walkthroughPoster %}poster="{{ site.servicesPage.walkthroughPoster }}"{% endif %}>
                <source src="{{ site.servicesPage.walkthroughVideo }}" type="video/mp4" />
                {% if site.servicesPage.walkthroughCaptions %}
                <track kind="captions" src="{{ site.servicesPage.walkthroughCaptions }}" srclang="en" label="English" />
                {% endif %}
                <a href="{{ site.servicesPage.walkthroughVideo }}">Watch the walkthrough</a>
            </video>
            {% else %}
            <p class="asset-placeholder cgi-demonstration__video">Walkthrough video pending</p>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="cgi-demonstration__copy">
                <p>Working from architectural drawings, photographs and site measurements where available, we create digital representations that help communicate spatial layouts, interior design proposals and the character of a property.</p>
                <p>Suitable for design presentations, property marketing and visualising spaces before refurbishment or furnishing.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
